# The four top edges of the extrusion of path_extrude chamfered, picked
# by clicking the top face and choosing Select Face Edges from its
# context menu; the same as path_face_edges.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalenceFaceEdges).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
popup Select Face Edges
down R 290 265
up R 290 265
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
